WEBVTT

00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:03.140
What is the point of life?

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:04.780
My answer is:

00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:07.740
to make life a little more worth living.

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:10.860
Maybe the universe has no purpose written into it.

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:13.260
But that doesn't make everything empty.

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:15.980
Pain matters to the person who feels it.

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:17.340
So does relief.

00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:19.180
So does being loved.

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:20.940
Meaning begins there:

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:22.380
in paying attention,

00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:23.500
making something,

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:24.780
learning something,

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:26.220
caring for someone.

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:27.900
And not only giving.

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:29.660
Receiving care counts.

00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:30.940
Rest counts.

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:32.220
Play counts.

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:35.260
You are not a machine for producing value.

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:36.300
We die.

00:00:36.420 --> 00:00:38.060
Our work can disappear.

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:41.580
A good moment doesn't become worthless because it ends.

00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:44.993
There may be no single destination for every life.

00:00:45.047 --> 00:00:47.140
There are directions we can choose.

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:48.940
Less needless suffering.

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:50.871
More room for wonder.

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:53.420
Tend the small light you can reach.

00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:55.020
Let someone tend yours.
